-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"plans-and-pricing\">Plans and pricing<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#plans-and-pricing\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>Start free. Every new account gets a <strong>14-day trial with Pro features</strong>, then moves to Free unless you\nsubscribe. The <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-pricing-page\">pricing page</a> always shows the live numbers; this page\nexplains them. Prices below are in US dollars; visitors in India see rupees only (the price is decided by\nour server from your country, never by a switch on the page).</p>\n<p><strong>Taxes.</strong> Rupee prices exclude GST: 18% GST is added at checkout (for example ₹7,999 / month + 18% GST),\nand businesses can claim it with their GSTIN. Dollar prices: taxes are calculated at checkout.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Free</th><th>Starter</th><th>Pro</th><th>Scale</th><th>Enterprise</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Price a month</td><td>$0</td><td>$29 (₹1,999 + 18% GST)</td><td>$99 (₹7,999 + 18% GST)</td><td>$499 (₹41,999 + 18% GST)</td><td>from $2,000, billed annually</td></tr><tr><td>Annual</td><td></td><td>$290 (₹19,990 + 18% GST)</td><td>$990 (₹79,990 + 18% GST)</td><td>$4,990 (₹4,19,990 + 18% GST)</td><td>contract</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>1 GB</td><td>10 GB</td><td>50 GB</td><td>250 GB</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Bandwidth a month</td><td>2 GB</td><td>20 GB</td><td>70 GB</td><td>400 GB</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>API calls a month</td><td>5,000</td><td>50,000</td><td>500,000</td><td>4,000,000</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Verse Homes a month</td><td>1</td><td>5</td><td>15</td><td>60</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Films a month</td><td>1</td><td>5</td><td>15</td><td>50</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Room captures a month</td><td>0</td><td>2</td><td>5</td><td>10</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Renders a month</td><td>20</td><td>200</td><td>300</td><td>500</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Seats</td><td>1</td><td>1</td><td>3</td><td>10</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>Max upload</td><td>500 MB</td><td>2 GB</td><td>10 GB</td><td>20 GB</td><td>custom</td></tr><tr><td>&quot;Made with Verse&quot; badge</td><td>on</td><td>off</td><td>off</td><td>off</td><td>white-label option</td></tr><tr><td>Support</td><td>community</td><td>email</td><td>priority</td><td>priority + 99.5% uptime</td><td>named specialist + SLA</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<ul><li><strong>Extra seats</strong> on Starter, Pro and Scale: $15 (₹999 + 18% GST) a month each, $150 (₹9,990 + 18% GST) a year.</li><li><strong>Annual</strong> billing is ten months&#39; price for twelve.</li><li><strong>Your viewers never need a plan or an account.</strong> A published scene keeps opening whatever plan its owner is on.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-you-reach-an-allowance\">When you reach an allowance<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#when-you-reach-an-allowance\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>We tell you at <strong>80%</strong> and again at <strong>100%</strong> (in the app, on your billing page, by email at most twice a\nweek, and on WhatsApp). At 100% that action stops until you upgrade or your billing month resets; nothing\nis deleted. Allowances reset on your billing date (on the 1st for Free and the trial).</p>\n<p>Bandwidth is the one exception that never breaks a link: if your scenes use all of the month&#39;s bandwidth,\nviewers keep opening them in a lighter version and you see a notice to upgrade.</p>\n<h2 id=\"pay-as-you-go-coming-soon\">Pay as you go (coming soon)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#pay-as-you-go-coming-soon\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>On paid plans you will be able to go past an allowance and pay only for the extra. Until it switches on,\nreaching an allowance asks you to upgrade and nothing extra is charged.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>USD</th><th>INR (+ 18% GST)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Bandwidth</td><td>$0.80 per GB</td><td>₹70</td></tr><tr><td>Storage</td><td>$0.25 per GB-month</td><td>₹22</td></tr><tr><td>API calls</td><td>$0.20 per 10,000</td><td>₹18</td></tr><tr><td>Verse Home</td><td>$1.00 each</td><td>₹90</td></tr><tr><td>Film</td><td>$0.75 each</td><td>₹65</td></tr><tr><td>Room capture</td><td>$2.00 each</td><td>₹170</td></tr><tr><td>Render</td><td>$0.02 each</td><td>₹2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"the-trial\">The trial<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-trial\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every new account (one per person and organisation) gets 14 days with Pro features and these allowances:\n5 GB storage, 10 GB bandwidth, 25,000 API calls, 3 Verse Homes, 3 films, 1 room capture, 50 renders,\n1 seat and uploads up to 2 GB. The badge stays on and custom branding is not included.</p>\n<p><strong>Upgrade during the trial</strong> and the offer is applied at checkout automatically: **25% off your first\n3 months<strong> on a monthly plan, or </strong>20% off your first year** on an annual plan. The offer ends with the trial.</p>\n<p>After 14 days the account moves to Free. Nothing is deleted and your scenes keep opening; creating more\nneeds a plan.</p>\n<h2 id=\"broker-packs\">Broker packs<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#broker-packs\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>One-time, prepaid packs made for WhatsApp: <strong>10 Verse Homes + 10 films for $12 (₹999 + 18% GST)</strong>, or **50 + 50 for\n$59 (₹4,999 + 18% GST)**. They are used after your plan&#39;s monthly allowance and never expire.</p>\n<h2 id=\"discount-codes\">Discount codes<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#discount-codes\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Enter a code on the pricing page, or open a link with the code in it (for example\n<code>verse.ctruh.com/pricing?code=YOURCODE</code>); the code is kept while you sign up. One code per purchase: a code\nis not combined with the trial offer (the bigger saving applies) unless the code says it can be.</p>\n<h2 id=\"plans-from-before-october-2026\">Plans from before October 2026<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#plans-from-before-october-2026\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<p>If you subscribed to Pro ($79), Studio, Verse for Real Estate or All Access, nothing you pay changes. Your\nsubscription keeps its plan and price, and gets the new allowances wherever those are higher than what you\nhad. These plans are no longer sold to new customers.</p>\n<h2 id=\"which-currency-you-pay-in\">Which currency you pay in<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#which-currency-you-pay-in\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-8\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Checkout is run by our payment partner, Dodo Payments, who adds the right sales tax, VAT or GST for your\ncountry and issues the invoice. Customers in India pay in rupees (cards, UPI, net banking); everyone else in\nUS dollars.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changing-plan\">Changing plan<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#changing-plan\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-9\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Upgrade</strong> from the pricing page or the upgrade sheet; the new plan applies at once.</li><li><strong>Cancel or downgrade</strong> in <strong>Billing</strong>; you keep the plan until the period you paid for ends, and your scenes stay. A payment that fails has a 7-day grace period before the plan drops.</li><li><strong>Refunds:</strong> within 7 days of your first payment (or of an annual renewal). See the <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/refunds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-refund-policy\">refund policy</a>, the <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-terms-2\">terms</a> and the <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-privacy-policy\">privacy policy</a>.</li><li><strong>Enterprise:</strong> request a callback on the pricing page; a specialist calls you back.</li><li>Not sure which plan? Write to hello@ctruh.com.</li></ul>\n<p>Sign in with a one-time code first: see <a href=\"/docs/guides/sign-in\" id=\"lnk-sign-in-2\">Sign in</a>.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/plans-and-pricing\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#when-you-reach-an-allowance\" id=\"lnk-when-you-reach-an-allowance\">When you reach an allowance</a><a href=\"#pay-as-you-go-coming-soon\" id=\"lnk-pay-as-you-go-coming-soon\">Pay as you go (coming soon)</a><a href=\"#the-trial\" id=\"lnk-the-trial\">The trial</a><a href=\"#broker-packs\" id=\"lnk-broker-packs\">Broker packs</a><a href=\"#discount-codes\" id=\"lnk-discount-codes\">Discount codes</a><a href=\"#plans-from-before-october-2026\" id=\"lnk-plans-from-before-october-2026\">Plans from before October 2026</a><a href=\"#which-currency-you-pay-in\" id=\"lnk-which-currency-you-pay-in\">Which currency you pay in</a><a href=\"#changing-plan\" id=\"lnk-changing-plan\">Changing plan</a></aside></section>"}